sqlmap — dynamic-content detection algorithm
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The anchor-discovery and dynamic-region-removal algorithms in
src/anchors.cpp (find_anchors / apply_anchors) and the structural-projection
helpers in src/projection.cpp (html_project / json_project and the tag/cls/id
token scheme) are derived from sqlmap:

    sqlmap — https://github.com/sqlmapproject/sqlmap
    Copyright (C) 2006-2026 Bernardo Damele Assumpcao Guimaraes, Miroslav Stampar
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2

Corresponding upstream functions:

    sqlmap lib/core/common.py :: findDynamicContent()      -> find_anchors()
    sqlmap lib/core/common.py :: removeDynamicContent()    -> apply_anchors()
    sqlmap lib/core/common.py :: extractStructuralTokens()  -> html_project()
    sqlmap lib/core/common.py :: jsonMinimize()             -> json_project()

