--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CPython — difflib.SequenceMatcher
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/difflib.cpp and src/difflib.hpp are a C++ port of the Python standard
library module difflib, specifically the class difflib.SequenceMatcher. The
port reproduces the CPython 3.10 implementation's behaviour so that the
similarity ratio computed in C++ matches the ratio computed by the Python
reference implementation.

