BLAKE2b (RFC 7693)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/blake2b.cpp and src/blake2b.hpp are an independent implementation of the
BLAKE2b-64 hash function specified in RFC 7693. RFC 7693 is an informational
document published by the IETF; the algorithm itself is not subject to
copyright. No third-party source code was copied.

